{"id":"nce1-063","book":"nce1","numbers":[63,64],"label":"Lesson 63–64","titleEn":"Thank You, Doctor.","titleCn":"谢谢你，医生","audio":"media/lessons/nce1/063.mp3","lines":[{"t":3.45,"en":"Thank you, doctor.","cn":"谢谢您，医生。"},{"t":6.45,"en":"Listen to the tape then answer this question.","cn":"先听这段录音，然后再回答这个问题。"},{"t":12.69,"en":"Who else is in bed today? Why?","cn":"今天还有谁在床上？为什么？"},{"t":19.22,"en":"How's Jimmy today?","cn":"Jimmy今天怎么样？"},{"t":21.58,"en":"Better.","cn":"更好了。"},{"t":22.7,"en":"Thank you, doctor.","cn":"谢谢您，医生。"},{"t":25.01,"en":"Can I see him please, Mrs. Williams?","cn":"请问威廉姆斯夫人，我能见见他吗？"},{"t":29.28,"en":"Certainly, doctor.","cn":"当然可以，医生。"},{"t":31.35,"en":"Come upstairs.","cn":"上来吧。"},{"t":34.17,"en":"You look very well, Jimmy.","cn":"你看起来气色很好，吉米。"},{"t":37.09,"en":"You are better now, but you mustn't get up yet.","cn":"你现在好多了，但还不能起床哦。"},{"t":42.6,"en":"You must stay in bed for another two days.","cn":"“你必须再卧床休息两天。”"},{"t":48.32,"en":"The boy mustn't go to school yet, Mrs. Williams.","cn":"“这个男孩还不能去上学，威廉姆斯夫人。”"},{"t":53.21,"en":"And he mustn't eat rich food.","cn":"“而且他也不能吃油腻的食物。”"},{"t":58.11,"en":"Does he have a temperature, doctor?","cn":"“医生，他发烧了吗？”"},{"t":62.09,"en":"No, he doesn't.","cn":"“没有，他没有发烧。”"},{"t":64.06,"en":"Must he stay in bed?","cn":"“他必须继续卧床吗？”"},{"t":67.06,"en":"Yes. He must remain in bed for another two days.","cn":"“是的，他必须再卧床两天。”"},{"t":72.84,"en":"He can get up for about two hours each day, but you must keep the room warm.","cn":"“他每天可以起来大约两个小时，但你们必须保持房间温暖。”"},{"t":83.49,"en":"Where's Mr. Williams this evening?","cn":"“威廉姆斯先生今晚在哪儿？”"},{"t":87.35,"en":"He's in bed, doctor.","cn":"“他也在床上，医生。”"},{"t":90.48,"en":"Can you see him please?","cn":"“您能去看看他吗？”"},{"t":93.24,"en":"He has a bad cold, too!","cn":"“他也得了重感冒！”"}],"words":[{"word":"better","phonetic":["'betə"],"pos":"a.","meaning":"形容词well的比较级","us":"media/words/nce1/w0494_a.mp3","uk":"media/words/nce1/w0494_e.mp3"},{"word":"certainly","phonetic":["'sə:tənli"],"pos":"ad.","meanin